- setupTestScene() now unconditionally resets the camera to Free scroll mode and snaps it to the new level's spawn point (both the success path and the fallback path), so a Locked/stale camera can never survive a level transition.
- render() now draws m_player/m_player2 after the general entity loop instead of relying on m_entities' insertion order, so a large foreground entity (Bowser, Boom Boom) can never paint over the player.
- Added tests/scripts/verify_1_3_camera_and_visibility.txt (committed, following the playtest_fixes_1_3.txt convention) and two new docs/verification/ screenshots with an honest caption on what was and was not observed live.
