Summary of Changes:
- Migrated every raw EventBus::SubscriptionId outside EventBus itself to EventBus::ScopedSubscription: PlayingState's 14 members (checkpoint, playerDied, fireball, starCoin, enemyDefeated, blockBroken, coinParticle, playerDamaged, powerUp, levelComplete, entitySpawn, pSwitch, pow, bridge — exit() now calls .reset() on each instead of checking a `static_cast<SubscriptionId>(-1)` sentinel and calling unsubscribe() by hand); AchievementManager and StatisticsTracker's std::vector<SubscriptionId> (shutdown() is now a one-line .clear()); Camera's std::vector<SubscriptionId> for screen-shake triggers (same simplification).
